OL,3,AA biopic, a coffee brand and dog treats
OL,4,Aamong Dolly Parton's business projects
OL,5,Astill to come
OL,6,
OL,7,FSinger and businesswoman Dolly Parton,
OL,8,Fwho died earlier this week, had a slew
OL,9,Fof projects in the pipeline including a
OL,10,Fbiopic, documentary, avatar show,
OL,11,Fmuseum, travel stop for truckers,
OL,12,Fcoffee brand and dog treats.
OL,14,F"Dolly worked up until the day she
OL,15,Fdied. She loved seeing her dreams come
OL,16,Fto life and loved knowing her work
OL,17,Fbrought people joy," her longtime
OL,18,Fmanager Danny Nozell told US media
OL,19,Fincluding Hollywood Reporter.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
